              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='17500' id='28' type-v2='text' w='99200' x='400' y='10375'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run>*Food vertical only
*Reporting Months present the Transition Month from MP to OD
*Transition month strictly from MP to OD between 2022 April and 2023 May
* Transition Month presents the performance of the vendor 90D before transition and 90D after transition
*Between the last MP order and last OD order needs to be a difference of at least 30D 
*Preorders are excluded
</run>
